  "body": "<div data-page-id=\"doxcnahxjA4rlz22FFlezgULbrb\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnI26cKuCSGSsEo3EdDl3Ydf\">To check your Reading Statistics in NeoReader, do the following:</div>\n<ol>\n<li>In Home Screen, go to<strong> Library</strong>.</li>\n<li>Tap the <strong>Reading Statistics</strong> button in the upper right corner.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcn0gImCowuue4i48V1pUehIb\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcn0gImCowuue4i48V1pUehIb\"><img src=\"https://booxsupport.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/10754754129684\" alt=\"9.13-1.jpg\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnQCcQo6ecMyMislWRUed8LH\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcncGeOGS2ESuqcwLlF6MU3rh\">Here you can find some useful statistics on your reading time based on each week, the amount of books read, etc. The Reading Statistics are available only on this device itself and cannot be synced to other devices.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnqSwGwuuOa2O8qwr9Cbc4kg\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnW02W6EOc44S6aquAyldLUg\">To enable / disable Reading Statistics, do the following:</div>\n<ol>\n<li>In Home Screen, go to<strong> Library</strong>.</li>\n<li>Tap the hamburger menu in the top right corner and choose <strong>Settings</strong> &gt; <strong>Library settings</strong>.</li>\n<li>Toggle on/off <strong>Enable reading statistics</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnesa0KGKIem4MyWTdYc5U8b\"> </div>\n</div>"
}
